# Sim events reach the client: controller.state.events lists each frame's
# events once, and `expect event` asserts on those seen since the case began
# (docs/design/basic-gameplay.md section 11).

case no events are seen on a quiet frame
start walk raft
frame 50 x2
expect no event block_tilled
expect no event crop_planted

case a tilled block is reported with its names
start walk raft
click
lock
press Backquote
type give tool hoe
press Enter
frame 50 x2
lock
stand field
expect no event block_tilled
button down right
frame 50 x2
button up right
frame 50 x2
expect event block_tilled from=grass
expect no event crop_planted

# The player spawns in the water, so no edge is seen until they leave and return.
case walking off the islet into the sea reports entered_water
start walk raft
click
lock
stand field
frame 50 x2
expect no event entered_water
down KeyW
until events > 0
up KeyW
expect event entered_water player=player
